# Docker build context excludes — root-anchored patterns only match the
# repo root, so dependency / build dirs in subpackages need `**/` to be
# walked recursively. Without these, a local `npm install` + `npm run dev`
# bloats the build context to 30+GB (apps/web/.next alone).
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.next-*
**/.turbo
**/.cache
**/dist
**/coverage
# apps/mobile is an Expo app — never built as a Docker service image, but its
# ios/android native dirs (Pods/.gradle/build) are ~2.8GB and bloated every
# service's upload context. Exclude wholesale.
apps/mobile
# glob-anchored so az acr build's UPLOAD packer honors them (it skips the
# literal root-anchored `apps/mobile` during upload, only at Docker-build time)
# — these are the ~2.8GB of regenerable native build artifacts.
**/.gradle
**/Pods
**/.cxx
**/android/build
**/android/app/build
# iOS build products (xcarchive/dSYMs/ipa, ~230MB) — mirror of the android
# globs above; store-release artifacts live outside the repo.
**/ios/build
# Local production / scratch output: review audio, generated clips, one-off
# exports (repo-root tmp/ alone was 1.2GB on 2026-07-17). Never in any image;
# every tmp dir in the repo is generated junk.
tmp
**/tmp
# Generated TV fixtures belong only to local development.
**/public/_dev
.git
.github
.claude
.agents
# Root `.env*` only matches repo root — use `**/` so apps/web/.env.local
# never ships in the ACR upload (Next.js would load it during `next build` and
# override Dockerfile-generated .env.production).
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local
*.tar
**/*.tar
*.tar.gz
**/*.tar.gz
# Exclude docs/READMEs from the upload context, but keep:
# - Agent Skill catalog sources (SKILL.md under packages/agent-skills/catalog)
# - Studio's downloadable Skill template under `public/` (copied into the image)
#
# Use `**/*.md` (not bare `*.md`): az acr build's Windows packer treats bare
# `*.md` like gitignore (recursive) and has historically dropped catalog
# SKILL.md even when a negation followed — which empties prune's catalog
# dirs and fails `@repo/agent-skills` with a false "stale catalog" error.
# Docker itself only matches bare `*.md` at the context root.
**/*.md
!packages/agent-skills/catalog/**/*.md
!apps/studio/public/**/*.md
# package.json is needed for npm install in the build — keep it.
!package.json
!**/package.json
# Agent runtime sqlite — gitignored local artifact, ~30MB each, never needed
# at build (a fresh checkout has none). az's packer ignores it via **/.
**/mastra.db
**/mastra.db-wal
**/mastra.db-shm
**/.mastra/output
